---- Property: The AICA system can initialize and create all required components
---- This is a basic sanity check to ensure the AICA system loads and initializes properly

sload ../aica.maude

omod AICA-BASIC-CHECK is
  inc AICA .

  vars P O G A D T M : Oid .
  var  S S' : String .
  var  Conf : Configuration .
  var  F : Float .
  var  N : Nat .

  ---- Abstract away button presses and value changes for this basic test
  eq buttonPressed(O, G, S) = none .
  eq valueChanged(O, G, S, S') = none .

endom

---- Test: AICA system can initialize without getting stuck
---- Expected: Should reach a stable state with AICA object created
search { <PCA> create(Aica, oid(0), oid(1)), 0 } 
       =>* { < P : Aica | busy : false > Conf, Tm } .

eof